# Cold store -- retired graph snapshots and oversized artifacts moved out of the
# working tree by `tools/fs_hygiene.py --kinds graph-snapshots --execute`.
# Regenerable, and it must never be committed. Same reasoning as graphify-out/
# above: it is a snapshot of the graph, not a source of truth. Kept ignored
# because fs_hygiene recreates var/cold on any future compaction.
var/

# Diagnostic dumps (regenerable, keep on disk)
pyright_*.txt
_pyright_*.txt
_mypy_*.txt
pyright_output.json
pyright_full*.txt
pyright_errs*.txt
pyright_now.txt
_debug_*.json
_benchmark_*.json
_e2e_*.json
_all_providers_*.json
_instruct_*.json
_eca_*.json

# Runtime evolution state — LIVE, mutated every 5 min by evolution_cycle.py.
# These must never be tracked: a git restore/checkout reverts them, which on
# 2026-09-10 silently bypassed the streak/holdout/promote/canary gates in
# reverse (production genes reverted 29.67 -> 28.23 with no promotion event).
# See EVOLUTION_PROCESS_AUDIT_20260910.md (D-1) / improvement item EV-1.
config/evolved_rl_params.json
config/evolved_rl_params.json.*
config/evolved_meta_params.json
state/evolved_rl_params.json
state/evolved_rl_params.json.*
state/evolution_pool_snapshot.json
state/evolution_pool_snapshot.json.tmp
state/holdout_cooldown.json
state/qd_archive.json
state/qd_archive.json.tmp
state/worm_policy.json
state/worm_policy.json.tmp
session_log*.txt
nul
